@startuml FIG-CL-TAV-08
skinparam shadowing false
title FIG-CL-TAV-08 v2. SysML 1.6 notation-based views; executable/metamodel conformance is not claimed
' Approved figlib candidate v2 mapped to controlled ids. Not a proof of equivalence.
' Displayed constraints include cmin, Kmax and Hk.
component IA
' entity IA: «constraint» / Allowed interval / I: allowed timing interval
component EP
' entity EP: «constraint» / Error bound / ε: measurement error
component JM
' entity JM: «constraint» / Measured interval / J: feasible interval from / measurement and ε
component UP
' entity UP: «constraint» / History update / H_{k+1} = {h ∈ H_k | / O(h, t, q_k) ∩ I_k ≠ ∅}
component CM
' entity CM: «constraint» / Positive cost / c_{min} > 0; cost(t) ≥ c_{min}; / cost(ERROR) ≥ c_{min}
component BU
' entity BU: «constraint» / Resource mode / B finite ⊕ K_{max} finite
component SC
' entity SC: «constraint» / Selection score / s(t) = worst remaining |H_k| / over Obs(t, q_k)
IA --> JM : b1 I
EP --> JM : b2 ε
JM --> UP : b3 J
SC --> UP : b4 H_k, Obs(t, q_k)
BU --> SC : b5 mode
CM --> BU : b6 c_{min}
note as NT
  Constraints are displayed, not claimed solved; vanishing positive costs do not prove termination.
end note
@enduml
